# INS / Index of NCI Studies

- Adapter: `Commons/apps/ins/app.py`; fixture `ins`; backend TSV + SQLite SQL.
  Loader and Datasets card reader: `Commons/apps/ins/tsv_source.py`.
- Programs exploration and Datasets exploration are different UI/read paths.
  `open_programs()` uses standard Programs, Projects, Grants, Publications tab
  comparisons. `open_datasets()` uses `verify_datasets()` and the card reader.
- Existing Excel action `verify_datasets_tab` deliberately dispatches to
  `app.verify_datasets()`. Do not call a nonexistent app method by the action name.
- Program filters: `Programs/cancertype.yaml` defines `CancerType/CancerType`;
  `Programs/specialtopic.yaml` defines `SpecialTopic/SpecialTopic`. Preserve
  existing checkbox tokens such as `BladderCancer` and `HIVAIDS`.
- Datasets repository group: `DataSets/Repository` -> `CEDCD`, `GEO`, `dbGaP`.
  It currently exists in both `data_sets.yaml` and `DataSets/repository.yaml`.
  Keep their explicit checkbox definitions aligned until deliberately consolidated.
- Navigation/results locators: `navbar.yaml`, `statbar.yaml`, `result_tabs.yaml`,
  `data_sets.yaml`. Static checks use the existing `static/v_*.yaml` pages.
- Keep Datasets card collection atomic per page: range, page size, complete card
  fields, and stable IDs must describe the same rendered page. Preserve duplicate
  detection and page JSON diagnostics; do not hide scraper defects by deduplicating
  results or replacing the reader with independent per-field reads.
- INS `read_statbar()` has an explicit app-specific wait. Do not move it into
  shared BaseApp behavior when changing this portal.
- Source archives include `Programs.zip` and `DataSetsTab.zip`; follow the INS
  extractor's supported paths. Their extracted folders remain ignored by Git.
- Read `stat_bar_omit` from configuration. Do not add omissions to hide failures;
  explain existing source limitations and revalidate before changing coverage.
- Queries must follow `expected-data.mdc`, including SQLite plan/timing checks.
